## Detailed Implementation Plan: 5 Cosmetic Shop UX Improvements

### Overview

This plan covers modifications to 3 files:
1. `CosmeticMainWindow.h` / `CosmeticMainWindow.cpp` -- Improvements 1, 2, 3, 4
2. `WjWorldCurrencySubsystem.h` / `WjWorldCurrencySubsystem.cpp` -- Improvement 5

The changes are designed to follow existing conventions discovered in the codebase, particularly the timer-based notification pattern found in `SumoHUDWidget` (BindWidgetOptional text + FTimerHandle + SetVisibility toggling).

---

### Improvement 5 (Bug Fix) -- GemPurchaseStartTime static variable

**Rationale**: Start with this because it is the smallest, most isolated change and has no dependencies on other improvements.

**Problem**: In `C:\UEProjects\WjWorld\Source\WjWorld\Currency\WjWorldCurrencySubsystem.cpp`, line 520, the variable `static float GemPurchaseStartTime = 0.0f;` is declared as a `static` local. This means it persists across all instances and all calls. If the subsystem is reinitialized (e.g., game instance reset), the stale value remains. Additionally, the `static` local is never properly scoped to the object lifetime.

**File: `C:\UEProjects\WjWorld\Source\WjWorld\Currency\WjWorldCurrencySubsystem.h`**

Add a new member variable in the private section (after line 146, near `bGemPurchasePending`):

```cpp
// Add after line 146: bool bGemPurchasePending = false;
float GemPurchaseStartTime = 0.0f;
```

**File: `C:\UEProjects\WjWorld\Source\WjWorld\Currency\WjWorldCurrencySubsystem.cpp`**

In `PollGemPurchaseResult()` (line 505-541), remove the `static` keyword from line 520:

Current (line 520):
```cpp
static float GemPurchaseStartTime = 0.0f;
```

Replace with removal of the entire local declaration. The function body now references the member variable `GemPurchaseStartTime` directly, which already works since the rest of the function accesses it by name. The lines at 524-534 remain unchanged -- they already read/write `GemPurchaseStartTime` by name.

Additionally, in `StopGemPurchasePolling()` or at the end of the timeout block, ensure `GemPurchaseStartTime` is reset. Looking at lines 531-535, the timeout block already resets it:
```cpp
bGemPurchasePending = false;
GemPurchaseStartTime = 0.0f;  // already done at line 534
StopGemPurchasePolling();
```

No other changes needed. The member variable is initialized to 0.0f in the header, and the existing logic in `PollGemPurchaseResult()` sets it from `World->GetTimeSeconds()` when it equals 0.0f (line 524-527), which is the correct startup behavior.

---

### Improvement 4 (Balance-Insufficient Button State) -- Refactor RefreshActionButton

**Rationale**: Do this before Improvement 3 because the button text logic (Improvement 3) is embedded within the same code path, and both changes to `RefreshActionButton()` should be designed together.

**Problem**: The action button is always enabled for unowned items in Shop mode (line 556 only checks `bPending`). Users can click "Buy" on items they cannot afford.

**File: `C:\UEProjects\WjWorld\Source\WjWorld\Currency\WjWorldCurrencySubsystem.h`**

No changes needed to this file for this improvement.

**File: `C:\UEProjects\WjWorld\Source\WjWorld\UI\Cosmetic\CosmeticMainWindow.cpp`**

Replace the "unowned item" branch in `RefreshActionButton()` (currently lines 541-573) with the following logic. The key insight is the "smart priority" described in the requirements: prefer the affordable currency, and only disable if no currency can cover the cost.

New logic for the else-block starting at line 540 (where `!CosmeticSub->HasItem(SelectedItemId)`):

```cpp
else
{
    // 미보유 아이템 -> 구매
    UWjWorldPurchaseSubsystem* PurchaseSub = GI->GetSubsystem<UWjWorldPurchaseSubsystem>();
    UWjWorldCurrencySubsystem* CurrencySub = GI->GetSubsystem<UWjWorldCurrencySubsystem>();
    bool bPending = PurchaseSub && PurchaseSub->IsPurchasePending();

    const FCosmeticItemDefinition* ItemDef = nullptr;
    if (CosmeticSub->GetCatalog())
    {
        ItemDef = CosmeticSub->GetCatalog()->FindByItemId(SelectedItemId);
    }

    if (bPending)
    {
        ActionButton->SetIsEnabled(false);
        ActionButtonText->SetText(NSLOCTEXT("Cosmetic", "Purchasing", "구매 중..."));
    }
    else if (ItemDef)
    {
        bool bHasCoinPrice = ItemDef->CoinPrice > 0;
        bool bHasGemPrice = ItemDef->GemPrice > 0;
        int32 CoinBalance = CurrencySub ? CurrencySub->GetBalance(ECurrencyType::Coin) : 0;
        int32 GemBalance = CurrencySub ? CurrencySub->GetBalance(ECurrencyType::Gem) : 0;
        bool bCanAffordCoin = bHasCoinPrice && CoinBalance >= ItemDef->CoinPrice;
        bool bCanAffordGem = bHasGemPrice && GemBalance >= ItemDef->GemPrice;

        if (bCanAffordCoin)
        {
            // Coin으로 구매 가능
            ActionButton->SetIsEnabled(true);
            ActionButtonText->SetText(FText::Format(
                NSLOCTEXT("Cosmetic", "PurchaseCoinAmount", "{0} Coin 구매"),
                FText::AsNumber(ItemDef->CoinPrice)));
            ActionButtonText->SetColorAndOpacity(FSlateColor(FLinearColor::White));
        }
        else if (bCanAffordGem)
        {
            // Gem으로 구매 가능
            ActionButton->SetIsEnabled(true);
            ActionButtonText->SetText(FText::Format(
                NSLOCTEXT("Cosmetic", "PurchaseGemAmount", "{0} Gem 구매"),
                FText::AsNumber(ItemDef->GemPrice)));
            ActionButtonText->SetColorAndOpacity(FSlateColor(FLinearColor::White));
        }
        else if (bHasCoinPrice || bHasGemPrice)
        {
            // 재화 가격이 존재하지만 잔액 부족
            ActionButton->SetIsEnabled(false);
            ActionButtonText->SetText(NSLOCTEXT("Cosmetic", "InsufficientBalance", "잔액 부족"));
            ActionButtonText->SetColorAndOpacity(FSlateColor(FLinearColor(0.8f, 0.2f, 0.2f, 1.f))); // 빨간색
        }
        else
        {
            // 재화 가격 없음 -> Steam 실결제
            ActionButton->SetIsEnabled(true);
            ActionButtonText->SetText(NSLOCTEXT("Cosmetic", "Purchase", "구매"));
            ActionButtonText->SetColorAndOpacity(FSlateColor(FLinearColor::White));
        }
    }
    else
    {
        ActionButton->SetIsEnabled(false);
        ActionButtonText->SetText(NSLOCTEXT("Cosmetic", "Purchase", "구매"));
    }
}
```

**Important detail**: Because we now set `ActionButtonText->SetColorAndOpacity()` in the insufficient case, we must also reset it to white in ALL other branches (Equip, Unequip, owned item branches). Add `ActionButtonText->SetColorAndOpacity(FSlateColor(FLinearColor::White));` in:
- The "보유 중인 아이템" branch (line 529, after `SetIsEnabled(true)`)
- The Inventory mode branch (line 579, after `SetIsEnabled(true)`)

This prevents the red color from persisting when the user switches from an unaffordable item to an equip action.

**Note on include**: The file already includes `Currency/WjWorldCurrencySubsystem.h` at line 11, so no new include is needed.

---

### Improvement 3 (Action Button Shows Price Amount)

This is already incorporated into Improvement 4 above. The button text now reads `"{0} Coin 구매"` or `"{0} Gem 구매"` instead of just `"Coin 구매"` or `"Gem 구매"`. No separate step is needed.

---

### Improvement 1 (Balance-Insufficient UI Feedback / Prevent Fallthrough to Steam)

**Problem**: In `OnActionButtonClicked()` (line 269-304), when `PurchaseItemWithCurrency()` returns false for both Coin and Gem, the code falls through to `PurchaseSub->RequestPurchase()` which triggers a real-money Steam purchase. This is dangerous UX.

**File: `C:\UEProjects\WjWorld\Source\WjWorld\UI\Cosmetic\CosmeticMainWindow.cpp`**

Rewrite the purchase logic in `OnActionButtonClicked()` (the else-block for "미보유 아이템" starting at line 269). The new logic should mirror the priority from `RefreshActionButton()`:

```cpp
else
{
    // 미보유 아이템 -> 재화 구매 또는 Steam 실결제
    const FCosmeticItemDefinition* ItemDef = CosmeticSub->GetCatalog() 
        ? CosmeticSub->GetCatalog()->FindByItemId(SelectedItemId) : nullptr;
    UWjWorldCurrencySubsystem* CurrencySub = GI->GetSubsystem<UWjWorldCurrencySubsystem>();

    bool bCurrencyPurchased = false;
    bool bHasCurrencyPrice = false;

    if (ItemDef && CurrencySub)
    {
        bool bHasCoinPrice = ItemDef->CoinPrice > 0;
        bool bHasGemPrice = ItemDef->GemPrice > 0;
        bHasCurrencyPrice = bHasCoinPrice || bHasGemPrice;

        int32 CoinBalance = CurrencySub->GetBalance(ECurrencyType::Coin);
        int32 GemBalance = CurrencySub->GetBalance(ECurrencyType::Gem);
        bool bCanAffordCoin = bHasCoinPrice && CoinBalance >= ItemDef->CoinPrice;
        bool bCanAffordGem = bHasGemPrice && GemBalance >= ItemDef->GemPrice;

        if (bCanAffordCoin)
        {
            bCurrencyPurchased = CurrencySub->PurchaseItemWithCurrency(SelectedItemId, ECurrencyType::Coin);
            if (bCurrencyPurchased)
            {
                UE_LOG(LogWjWorldCosmetic, Log, TEXT("CosmeticMainWindow: Coin purchase requested for %s"), *SelectedItemId.ToString());
            }
        }
        else if (bCanAffordGem)
        {
            bCurrencyPurchased = CurrencySub->PurchaseItemWithCurrency(SelectedItemId, ECurrencyType::Gem);
            if (bCurrencyPurchased)
            {
                UE_LOG(LogWjWorldCosmetic, Log, TEXT("CosmeticMainWindow: Gem purchase requested for %s"), *SelectedItemId.ToString());
            }
        }
    }

    if (!bCurrencyPurchased)
    {
        if (bHasCurrencyPrice)
        {
            // 재화 가격이 존재하지만 잔액 부족 -> Steam 실결제로 넘기지 않음
            ShowNotification(NSLOCTEXT("Cosmetic", "InsufficientBalanceNotice", "잔액이 부족합니다"), false);
            UE_LOG(LogWjWorldCosmetic, Log, TEXT("CosmeticMainWindow: Insufficient currency for %s"), *SelectedItemId.ToString());
        }
        else
        {
            // 재화 가격 없음 -> Steam 실결제
            UWjWorldPurchaseSubsystem* PurchaseSub = GI->GetSubsystem<UWjWorldPurchaseSubsystem>();
            if (PurchaseSub && !PurchaseSub->IsPurchasePending())
            {
                PurchaseSub->RequestPurchase(SelectedItemId);
                UE_LOG(LogWjWorldCosmetic, Log, TEXT("CosmeticMainWindow: Steam purchase requested for %s"), *SelectedItemId.ToString());
            }
        }
    }
}
```

Key change: Items that have a CoinPrice or GemPrice will NEVER fall through to Steam real-money purchase. Only items with both CoinPrice == 0 and GemPrice == 0 will reach `RequestPurchase()`.

The `ShowNotification()` function referenced here is added in Improvement 2 below.

---

### Improvement 2 (Purchase Success/Failure Toast Notification)

**Problem**: `OnCurrencyPurchaseComplete()` and `OnPurchaseComplete()` only call `RefreshUI()`, giving no visible feedback.

**File: `C:\UEProjects\WjWorld\Source\WjWorld\UI\Cosmetic\CosmeticMainWindow.h`**

Add the following in the protected section, after `GemChargeButton` (line 115):

```cpp
/** 알림 텍스트 (구매 성공/실패 피드백) */
UPROPERTY(meta = (BindWidgetOptional))
TObjectPtr<UTextBlock> NotificationText;
```

Add in the private section (after `static constexpr int32 GridColumnCount = 4;` at line 237):

```cpp
